<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In MirrorFuzz: Leveraging LLM and Shared Bugs for Deep Learning Framework APIs Fuzzing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VII </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Related Work</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In MirrorFuzz: Leveraging LLM and Shared Bugs for Deep Learning Framework APIs Fuzzing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VIII </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Future Work</span></span></a></li>
